Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:30:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Revert "ASoC: qcom: qdsp6: add topology-driven Audio IF
 support"

The earlier FROMLIST version omitted a break after handling the Audio
IF source and sink modules. This caused the switch to fall through to
the shared-memory endpoint setup.

Revert it before applying the corrected upstream version.

This reverts commit 905332e74e23a78443dabbcae7f65ba425b2c97e.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Mohit Sharma <mohis@qti.qualcomm.com>
